  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "On grants",
      "items": [
        "Chat with the bot in bb; its Bot Chat is a pinned bb thread. All its outside chats mirror into bb.",
        "Full access to operate bb: the bot's plugin-owned bb skill calls the bb-hermes wrapper, which runs the bb CLI. Hermes doesn't ask before running bb commands. Restrictions come later.",
        "The switch row shows the import count before you turn it on (\"Imports 12 chats from the last 30 days\"). The switch is the consent; the import is silent."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What the worker writes",
      "items": [
        "One wrapper per Hermes machine: <plugin data>/bin/bb-hermes. It sets BB_SERVER_URL only when the bb server is remote.",
        "One bb skill per enabled bot: <profile>/skills/bb-plugin-hermes/, with a marker file. No config.yaml or .env edit, no Hermes restart.",
        "After writing or deleting the skill it runs hermes -p <profile> sessions refresh-prompts, so continuing chats (the Bot Chat) see the change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Off means",
      "items": [
        "Every bb thread of the bot is archived, the bot thread included (D48). Switching on again unarchives them and catches up turns made while off.",
        "The worker deletes that bot's skill, and the wrapper once no bot is on. A bot's own bb skills stay untouched.",
        "Every bot starts off."
      ]
    }
  ]
